{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1787400238357498001,"compiled_state":{"alias":"expectable-slowwitted-squeaker","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"df5a89adefe91e722389fe6bfbaf7a8aa44fedac3389269d05d7db4fe41c0373","event_uuid":"e67d92e8-3929-4065-ba29-f5c46302b019","position":{"commit_sha":"61d2a148e4f08e6c8243ddaca7dd07dee9bfc510","position":"1787396225978182001-e67d92e8-3929-4065-ba29-f5c46302b019"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"7641f5fc19cf857ed19326e5a21ff99afbb95d6aee581c36ec1b0b7fc91f1dcc","event_uuid":"06a02a2d-fdd5-49ed-b814-828be576ee7b","position":{"commit_sha":"1d959d8de82bba9c4ceb4ab0584384691950645c","position":"1787396235977730001-06a02a2d-fdd5-49ed-b814-828be576ee7b"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787396225978182001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"06a02a2d-fdd5-49ed-b814-828be576ee7b","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"ad2e-5db8-7ad0-4fa4"}],"description":"## Context\nDuring the F07 documentation-link validation run, the full test suite failed while a fixture created a ticket in an isolated temporary store. `src/rebar/_store/event_commit_git.py` terminated `git commit` after the 30-second `_GIT_TIMEOUT`. The completion-attestation behavior under test did not run. The exact node passed alone in 55.48 seconds.\n\nClosed ticket `moldavite-evasive-elephant` classifies the earlier occurrence as runner I/O contention during a long test job and directs maintainers to track a recurrence separately. Closed ticket `royal-weariless-zebrafish` addresses store-lock acquisition before the write body. It does not address a timeout after acquisition while `git commit` is running.\n\n## Plan\n- Reproduce the timeout under controlled concurrent temporary-store writes and capture subprocess timing.\n- Distinguish host I/O contention from incorrect timeout or fixture behavior.\n- Correct the proven failure class without retrying an unexplained intermittent failure.\n- Add focused regression coverage for the confirmed mechanism.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The root cause is demonstrated with repeatable evidence.\n- [ ] A regression test fails for the confirmed mechanism before the fix.\n- [ ] The fix addresses the failure class rather than one observed run.\n- [ ] Focused store and lifecycle tests pass.\n- [ ] The ticket records the relationship to `moldavite-evasive-elephant` and `royal-weariless-zebrafish`.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":["test-reliability","git","store"],"ticket_id":"bd66-28a4-fd31-4c9f","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Diagnose temporary-store git commit timeout under suite load","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["e67d92e8-3929-4065-ba29-f5c46302b019","06a02a2d-fdd5-49ed-b814-828be576ee7b"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787400238357498001,"uuid":"040e005c-4ec3-49f7-9850-d499b93b1a2a"}